        "seg_cer": 0.059,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今天大年初四，好吃佬关心的还是好吃的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 10.066,
      "end": 15.178,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "今天我们结束去龙城去走走看看体验一下那开年的味，",
      "score": 0.609,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.8821,
        "sc_logprob": -1.7771,
        "sc_delta": 0.105,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.797,
        "seg_cer": 0.348,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.143,
        "phon_examples": "龙/农",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今天我们继续去农村，去走走看看，体验下那里的年味。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 15.178,
      "end": 19.21,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "看着我们春节前就开始准备了那些好吃的。",
      "score": 0.1022,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2511,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2347,
        "sc_delta": 0.0164,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.001,
        "seg_cer": 0.222,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "看守堂春节前就开始准备了哪些好吃的？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 19.526,
      "end": 24.431,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "像美食走进好吃老一样，好吃老的人走进美食马上就要过年了。",
      "score": 0.3791,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.1123,
        "sc_logprob": -1.0903,
        "sc_delta": 0.022,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.421,
        "seg_cer": 0.385,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "杨美食走进哈市老杨，看哈市老林。走进美食，马上就要过年了，林。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 24.431,
      "end": 27.572,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "人家有什么传统项目或者是传统美食，",
      "score": 0.5312,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.1176,
        "sc_logprob": -2.0269,
        "sc_delta": 0.0907,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.912,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "有什么传统项目，或者是传统美食？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 27.8,
      "end": 29.851,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "是过年一定要做的嘞，",
      "score": 0.2012,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6839,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6409,
        "sc_delta": 0.043,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.212,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "是过年一定要做的呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 30.044,
      "end": 37.204,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "是要炸米花、炸呃玉兰片、炸扣肉嘞，还是要蒸年糕、蒸糯米、打粑粑嘞？",
      "score": 0.1747,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0209,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0214,
        "sc_delta": -0.0005,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.185,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.2,
        "phon_examples": "兰/腩",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "是要炸米饭、炸呃鱼腩片、炸扣肉的，还是要蒸年糕、蒸糯米、打粑粑的？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 37.204,
      "end": 45.229,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "现在城里头的年味是越来越淡了，所以大家没今天就大家去村里头去体验一下顺手工打粑粑，",
      "score": 0.0586,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0953,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0883,
        "sc_delta": 0.007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.128,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "现在城里头的年味是越来越淡了，所以辣椒妹今天就带大家去城里头去体验一下顺手工打粑粑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 45.229,
      "end": 51.341,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "体验一下我们的年味。今天我们是来到了叠彩区大河乡的大城，",
      "score": 0.0721,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2558,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2653,
        "sc_delta": -0.0095,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.003,
        "seg_cer": 0.154,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "体验一下我们的年味。今天我们是来到了电车区大货箱的大城。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 51.485,
      "end": 57.485,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这个村子的村民每年过年的时候都要制作顺手工做的糍粑。",
      "score": 0.0183,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0488,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0636,
        "sc_delta": -0.0148,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.04,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个村子的村民每年过年的时候，都要制作顺手工粥的糍粑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 57.726,
      "end": 60.354,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "今天我们是受到村民王大姐的邀请，",
      "score": 0.3701,
      "wav": "",
